ve some sun for a rainy day.","zh":"我喜欢把阳光留到下雨天来用。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"It can get you out of a pickle or into an E.M.Peach.","zh":"阳光可以让你摆脱接下来的困境，也可以让你获得脉冲黄桃。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"}],"FUTURE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_A":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Protect those Citrons!","zh":"保护好那些柚子！"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Short"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"It takes a lot of pulp to stand your ground like that.","zh":"他们像这样坚守前线需要很大的勇气。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"}],"FUTURE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A":[{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"You can pick your friends, but you can't pick these plants.","zh":"你可以选择你的朋友，但你选不了自己的植物。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"But some of my best friends are plants!","zh":"但我一些最好的朋友是植物！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"FUTURE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR":[{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Welcome back Gardener,","zh":"我们又见面了，园丁，"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Short"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"In this year your brains were collected ages ago.","zh":"在这个时间点你的脑子在好几百年前就被我们取走了。"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Collect them again soon, Dr. Edgar Zomboss.","zh":"马上我会再取走它一次的。埃德加·僵尸博士"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Watch out neighbor, I'm pretty sure he wasn't talking about my BRAINS!","zh":"小心点邻居，我很肯定他刚刚不是在说我的脑子。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"I would say there's evidence to the contrary.","zh":"我想说的是，有证据表明情况恰恰相反。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"}],"FUTURE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"The Future! Weird, I thought I would be hungrier.","zh":"欢迎来到未来！奇怪，我以为我会变得更饿的。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"After all I haven't eaten in 4000 years!","zh":"毕竟我都 4000 年没吃东西了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"...","zh":"……"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Short"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Hey, what happened to the lawn? It’s so glowy!","zh":"嘿，我们的草坪怎么回事？到处在发光！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I'm detecting an array of Power Tiles on the space-lawn.","zh":"我检测到这太空草坪上排列好了“超能瓷砖”。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}],"FUTURE_CHALLENGE_SUNBOMBS_A":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"You know how sometimes suns are bombs?","zh":"你知道在某些情况下太阳就是炸弹吗？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"This is one of these times!","zh":"现在就满足那样的情况了喔！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"FUTURE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I spy with my crazy eye a U.F.B.! An unidentified flying brain!","zh":"我用我疯狂的眼睛探测到了一个 U.F.B.！不明飞行脑！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Something more formidable than a brain lies within.","zh":"比这颗大脑更强大的东西就在其中。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"}]},"ui":{"note_future":{"image":"future/ui/a973e17f-797e-4c77-9825-14513e9d5e65_f9941.webp","width":950,"height":600,"insets":[0,0,0,0],"name":"future"}}}
